    ("Why is Desi chickpea preferred over Kabuli in rainfed (Barani) areas?", "Desi chickpea has a much deeper root system, stronger drought tolerance, and better resistance to local diseases (like blight and wilt) compared to Kabuli.", "Varieties: Desi vs Kabuli"),
