    ("Can chickpea tolerate heavy frost during its growth?", "Young plants can tolerate mild frost, but severe frost during the flowering or early pod formation stage can completely destroy the flowers and halt grain setting.", "Botany & Basics"),
    ("Are Kabuli varieties more susceptible to pests than Desi varieties?", "Yes, the thinner seed coat and lack of certain bitter biochemicals in Kabuli chickpeas make them highly susceptible to pests like the Gram Pod Borer and soil fungi.", "Varieties: Desi vs Kabuli"),
    ("What is the difference in seed size between Desi and Kabuli?", "Desi seeds are small and angular (10-20 grams per 100 seeds), while Kabuli seeds are large and round (25-50 grams per 100 seeds).", "Varieties: Desi vs Kabuli"),
    ("Why do Kabuli chickpeas fetch a higher market price?", "Because they have a premium appearance, higher consumer demand for whole-grain cooking, and lower overall yields/supply compared to Desi types.", "Varieties: Desi vs Kabuli"),
